that happen to have been made by hts_hopen\\(\\) while leaving\nthe original one intact.  File cleanup for htsget redirects is\nalso changed slightly so that the correct handles get closed on a\nsuccessful return.\")\n\nShow description for a01e107 \n\n[ daviesrob ](/samtools/htslib/commits?author=daviesrob)\n\nauthored and \n\n[ whitwham ](/samtools/htslib/commits?author=whitwham)\n\ncommitted  on Sep 29, 2023 \n\n[ a01e107  ](/samtools/htslib/commit/a01e107b744d372b5e26f40a78bd2d4724295a81)\n\nCopy full SHA for a01e107 \n\n[ ](/samtools/htslib/blob/a01e107b744d372b5e26f40a78bd2d4724295a81/hts.c) [ ](/samtools/htslib/tree/a01e107b744d372b5e26f40a78bd2d4724295a81)\n\nMore actions \n\n\n\n\n<::before>\n\n###  Commits on Jul 31, 2023 \n\n  * ####  [ Add \"uncompressed\" in hts_format_description() where appropriate ](/samtools/htslib/commit/5098983e426ac74bf0d1edaf5e8902bab72e5947 \"Add \")\n\nShow description for 5098983 \n\n[ jmarshall ](/samtools/htslib/commits?author=jmarshall)\n\nauthored and \n\n[ whitwham ](/samtools/htslib/commits?author=whitwham)\n\ncommitted  on Jul 31, 2023 \n\n[ 5098983  ](/samtools/htslib/commit/5098983e426ac74bf0d1edaf5e8902bab72e5947)\n\nCopy full SHA for 5098983 \n\n[ ](/samtools/htslib/blob/5098983e426ac74bf0d1edaf5e8902bab72e5947/hts.c) [ ](/samtools/htslib/tree/5098983e426ac74bf0d1edaf5e8902bab72e5947)\n\nMore actions \n\n\n\n\n<::before>\n\n###  Commits on Jul 19, 2023 \n\n  * ####  [ Make last_in a pointer to const [minor] ](/samtools/htslib/commit/6285a68f81464a5b96639034cf6aa2c49069f920 \"Make last_in a pointer to const \\[minor\\]\n\nZlib can be configured such that zs.next_in is a pointer to const.\")\n\nShow description for 6285a68 \n\n[ jmarshall ](/samtools/htslib/commits?author=jmarshall)\n\nauthored and \n\n[ jkbonfield ](/samtools/htslib/commits?author=jkbonfield)\n\ncommitted  on Jul 19, 2023 \n\n[ 6285a68  ](/samtools/htslib/commit/6285a68f81464a5b96639034cf6aa2c49069f920)\n\nCopy full SHA for 6285a68 \n\n[ ](/samtools